	"data": "Concept: Semantic Web & Linked Data\n\nWhat It Is\nTim Berners-Lee's vision for a machine-readable web — data published with typed relationships (RDF triples: subject → predicate → object) so programs can combine and reason across datasets.\n\ncithoreal spent significant time studying this as direct input for the Thought Bubbles architecture.\n\nCore Standards (from journals — Oct 2022 deep study session)\nRDF — statements as triples: subject predicate object\nRDFS — schema/class/property layer on top…",
